@startuml pattern-workflows
!theme plain
title Live-Check Pattern Workflows\nAll 5 JTBD Scenarios

|Developer|
start
:Start feature\ndevelopment;

|Local Dev Pattern|
:Terminal 1:\nStart live-check;
note right
  ./scripts/dev_live_check.sh
  - Real-time streaming
  - Port 4317
  - Colorized output
end note

:Terminal 2:\nRun tests;
note right
  export OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=\
    http://localhost:4317
  cargo test --features otel
end note

:See violations\nin real-time;

if (Violations?) then (yes)
  :Fix code\nimmediately;
  detach
else (no)
  :Continue coding;
endif

|Developer|
:Code complete,\nready to commit;

|Pre-Commit Pattern|
:Run git commit;
note right
  Automatic trigger
  via .git/hooks/pre-commit
end note

:Start live-check\n(background);

:Run tests for\nchanged files;

:Stop live-check\nand parse results;

if (Violations?) then (yes)
  :Block commit\nwith error message;
  note right
    Show violations
    Exit code 1
  end note
  stop
else (no)
  :Allow commit\nto proceed;
endif

|Developer|
:Push to remote;

|CI/CD Pattern|
:GitHub Actions\ntrigger;
note right
  On: push, pull_request
  Branches: master, main
end note

fork
  :Install Weaver;
fork again
  :Setup Rust;
fork again
  :Cache dependencies;
end fork

:Start live-check\n(port 4317);

:Build project\n(--features otel);

:Run all tests\n(full suite);

:Stop live-check\ngracefully;

:Parse results\nand extract metrics;

fork
  :Generate\nGitHub summary;
fork again
  :Upload artifacts;
fork again
  if (PR?) then (yes)
    :Comment on PR\nwith results;
  endif
end fork

if (Violations > 0?) then (yes)
  :Quality gate FAIL\nBlock merge;
  note right
    Exit code 1
    Status check fails
  end note
  stop
else (no)
  :Quality gate PASS\nAllow merge;
endif

|Developer|
:Weekly sprint\nmetrics;

|Coverage Pattern|
:Run track_coverage.sh;

:Start live-check;

:Run all tests\n(comprehensive);

:Stop and collect\ncoverage metrics;

:Save history\nJSON file;

:Generate trend\nchart;

if (Coverage < baseline?) then (yes)
  :Warn: below 80%\ntarget;
endif

:View dashboard;
note right
  python3 scripts/coverage_dashboard.py
  - Last 30 days
  - ASCII charts
  - Statistics
end note

|Operations|
:Production\nmonitoring;

|Production Pattern|
:Kubernetes CronJob\ntrigger (15 min);

:Collect telemetry\nsample from prod;

:Validate sample\nwith Weaver;

:Parse results;

if (Violations?) then (yes)
  fork
    :Send Slack alert;
  fork again
    :Trigger PagerDuty;
  fork again
    :Log to metrics;
  end fork

  :Alert on-call\nengineer;
  note right
    🚨 Production telemetry
    violations detected
  end note
else (no)
  :Log metrics\nonly;
endif

:Export to\nPrometheus;

stop

legend right
  **Response Times:**
  | Pattern | Time |
  | Local Dev | Real-time |
  | Pre-Commit | 10-30s |
  | CI/CD | 2-5 min |
  | Coverage | 5-10 min |
  | Production | 1-5 min |
endlegend

@enduml
